msgid ""
"Specify the list of instances to use. Pipeline can maintain this list "
"automatically, which will refresh it on every startup. You can freely modify "
"this list if you have your own Piped instances you want to use. The requests "
"will be balanced across all listed instances. For a complete list of public "
"APIs, see the <a href=\"https://github.com/TeamPiped/documentation/blob/main/"
"content/docs/public-instances/index.md\">Instances page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipelinek YouTubeko bideoak eskuratzeko erabili dituen Piped instantziak. "
"Pipelinek zerrenda hau automatikoki manten dezake, abioan beti eguneratuko "
"delarik. Zerrenda hau libreki aldatzeko aukera ere baduzu, erabili nahi "
"dituzun Piped instantzia propioak badituzu. Eskaerak zerrendako instantzia "
"guztien artean oreka bilatuz egingo dira. API publikoen zerrenda osatua "
"lortzeko, ikusi <a href=\"https://github.com/TeamPiped/documentation/blob/"
"main/content/docs/public-instances/index.md\">instantzien orria</a>."

